{"4957880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "They Came From Above", "steam_appid": 4957880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Came From Above</strong> is a story-driven psychological horror game set in the late 1970s. After your family mysteriously disappears following a series of terrifying dreams, you must explore, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth behind an extraterrestrial phenomenon that may signal the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience alien abduction first-hand.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find out what &quot;They&quot; want.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They Came From Above</i> features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Jump scares.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Low poly graphics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Late-70s environments.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-like game features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stealth mechanics as you're hunted by other-worldly beings.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple endings that depend on the choices you make in game.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957880/extras/43783f93994ee6518e35af72514e4d92.poster.avif?t=1785961029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957880/extras/43783f93994ee6518e35af72514e4d92.webm?t=17